<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson mobile phone squeeze below expectations.</title>
<headline>Ericsson mobile phone squeeze below expectations.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms giant Ericsson said on Friday that it had seen lower than expected price pressures on mobile phones in the first quarter of the year.</p>
</text>
